# Walkthrough - Spendigo Mobile Expansion & Cleanup

I have completed the requested expansion and cleanup tasks for the Spendigo application. This included resolving persistent broken image issues and extending the System Admin Dashboard.

## Key Accomplishments

### 1. Resolved Broken Image Links
I identified and fixed multiple broken Unsplash image links that were causing 404 errors in the [SmartCart](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/SmartCartWishlist.tsx#89-328) and [StoreDetail](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/StoreDetail.tsx#435-661) components. After several iterations to find stable URLs, all images are now loading correctly.

**Verified Fixed Items:**
- Cheddar Cheese (400g)
- Baguette
- Penne Rigate (900g)
- Black Beans (540ml)

### 2. Admin Dashboard Expansion
I successfully implemented and routed the new sections of the System Admin Dashboard.

- **Audit Logs:** Accessible at `/admin/audit-logs`. Provides a system-wide view of activities.
- **Flyer Moderation:** Accessible at `/admin/flyers`. Allows administrators to review OCR results and approve extracted deals.

## Verification Results

